# Build artifacts
build/
build_*/
build-*/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
# VS Code extension bundle output (npm run compile)
vscode/qzjs-debug/out/

# Generated files — 内嵌字节码是**纯构建产物**，不 committed
# dist/polyfill.js + dist/polyfill.bytecode + src/polyfill_default.c and
# dist/worker-boot.bytecode + src/worker_boot_default.c are all generated by
# polyfill/build.js (esbuild bundle → qjsc → C array) at build time and are
# deliberately NOT tracked: they are non-reproducible (same sources, two builds
# can differ by a few bytes), so a committed copy inevitably drifts from what a
# build actually embeds — which is exactly what the fuzz-corpus align gate and
# the "bytecode vs polyfill/src" reviews kept tripping over. Building qzjs now
# requires the polyfill toolchain (node + npm --prefix polyfill ci); see
# docs/dev/ or CI for per-job setup. Per-mode generated sources listed
# explicitly (not src/polyfill_*.c) so a future hand-written
# src/polyfill_<name>.c is not silently ignored.
dist/
polyfill.js
src/polyfill_default.c
src/worker_boot_default.c
src/polyfill_compressed.c
src/polyfill_external.c
src/polyfill_host.c

# fuzz 语料里「字节码前缀」那四个种子是内嵌字节码的派生产物，随构建重新生成
# （test/gen_fuzz_seeds.py，CMake 的 fuzz_seeds_gen 目标）：内嵌字节码由 qjsc 在
# 构建期生成且逐位不可复现，committed 的前缀种子无法稳定匹配任一次构建的字节码，
# 对齐门（fuzz_corpus_align_check.py）因此恒红。crash/oom/哈希名那些是 fuzz 发现
# 的历史输入，与字节码无对应关系，仍 committed。
test/fuzz-corpus/seed-polyfill-head*.bc
test/fuzz-corpus/seed-workerboot.bc

# Node.js
node_modules/
package-lock.json
# but commit lockfiles a CI job installs from (reproducibility)
!docs/package-lock.json
!vscode/qzjs-debug/package-lock.json
!src/polyfill/package-lock.json

